This game had a really ruff launch; 

But now at its current state, its fun, its its own taste of space sim, I love it. Its calming and enjoyable and honestly can be as deep as you like. 

It has story, and now multiplayer and countless features, I honestly hope more people give this game some love as its an honest to heart good game and needs the love it deserves; They stuck true to the community and have made everything free, small entry fee but the drinks are free!

