Props to Hello Games for staying with this one, but the more features they add the less technically sound the game gets. With the Foundation update I was experiencing crashes 1hr into playtime which erased progress; even if I had saved prior to the crash. High memory usage (probable memory leak?), weak gameplay past the first hour. Will return if the game gets off the ground.

